---
layout: layout.njk
permalink: /history/
title: History
description: What changed in the things I’ve built, newest first, each with its source.
---
<section class="intro">
  <h1>History</h1>
  <p class="lede">What changed in the things I’ve built, newest first. Every event links to a public source. Dates are as exact as the source lets them be, and a first commit tells you when the code started, not when the thing launched.</p>
  <p class="muted">Follow along: <a href="/feed.xml">RSS</a> · <a href="/feed.json">JSON Feed</a></p>
</section>
{% for bucket in site.years %}
<section class="year" id="{{ bucket.year }}">
  <h2>{{ bucket.year }}</h2>
  <ol class="event-list">
    {% for event in bucket.events %}
    <li id="{{ event.id }}">
      <time datetime="{{ event.date }}">{{ event.date | date }}</time>
      <span class="kind kind-{{ event.kind }}">{{ event.kind }}</span>
      <strong>{{ event.title }}</strong>
      <p>{{ event.summary }} <a href="{{ event.source | ref("source") }}">Source</a></p>
      <p class="muted">{% for id in event.things %}{% set other = site | thing(id) %}<a href="{{ other.page }}">{{ other.title }}</a>{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}</p>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>
{% endfor %}
